ps, and is averse to being looked at sexually by men."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is married, but she regrets her marriage, and her stress is unknowingly directed at the main character."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has no tolerance for pleasure because her husband only has selfish sex with her and has never given her any pleasure."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c25599"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のクラス担任である女教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エリート意識が強くキツイ性格で生徒にも厳しい指導を行なう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"持ち前の巨乳とくびれのよいスタイルで男性受けする容姿だが本人は恋愛事にうとく、むしろ男性から性的な目でみられることに嫌悪を感じるタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同僚である白河美和し、理想論を語りつつも認めるところのある、良きライバル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園内では対立することも多いが、同じ既婚者としてプライベートでの相談相手でもある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5339","sourceWorkId":"21099","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のクラス担任である女教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"キツイ性格でエリート意識が強く、教え子には厳しい指導を行なう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性と比較されることがコンプレックスで、それに反発するように優秀な学歴を積み上げてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛ごとには疎く、男性から性的な目で見られることに嫌悪を感じている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"既婚だが結婚したことを後悔しており、そのストレスが知らずに主人公へ向かっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫が自分勝手なセックスしかせず快感を得たことが無いため、快楽への耐性が無い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"89980"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"29 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5339","sourceWorkId":"21099","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"92 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5339","sourceWorkId":"21099","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"169 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5339","sourceWorkId":"21099","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"91 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5339","sourceWorkId":"21099","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5339","sourceWorkId":"21099","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5dd9139d0a920a7d871fc818685ee8096637ef32fd5e495cc68a2dce1d48b932.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/975448363f1371bb0af47be93d1b2d1eb03b2256c8851d4759d061cbcca0939e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"計名 さや香","creatorId":"vndb:s859","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s859","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s859","name":"かずなさやか(計名さや香)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:60755","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c25600","characterName":"白河 美和","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"89981","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"167746"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5340"],"vndbCharacterId":"c25600"},"originalCharacterName":"白河 美和","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"32"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"94"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"92"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"62"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A female teacher who is the assistant homeroom teacher in the protagonist's class."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a serious and straightforward personality. She is also very friendly and treats her students kindly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has recently announced her marriage to a man she knows."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has only had sex with her husband."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a strong desire to have children, but is dissatisfied with her husband's indifference and neglect."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She feels that it would be a shame to make an aggressive appeal to her husband, so she is unable to talk to anyone about it."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c25600"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"人当たりがよくまじめで素直な女性教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父子家庭でまじめに努力する主人公に優しく接する。主人公憧れの女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"職務は真面目で生徒にも優しいが、子供を持ちたいという願望が強くセックスについても夫が淡泊で回答も少ないことが内心の不満。しかし、自分から積極的にアピールしてしまっては、女性としてはしたない、と考え誰にも言えずにいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5340","sourceWorkId":"21099","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のクラスで副担任を務める女教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まじめで素直な性格。 人当たりが良く、学生にも優しく接する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近、知り合いの男性との結婚を発表した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"セックスの経験は夫とのみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供を持ちたいという願望が強いが、夫が淡白で回数も少ないことに不満を抱いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分から積極的にアピールするのははしたないと考えているため、誰にも相談できずにいる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"89981"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"32 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5340","sourceWorkId":"21099","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"94 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5340","sourceWorkId":"21099","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"162 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5340","sourceWorkId":"21099","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"92 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5340","sourceWorkId":"21099","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"62 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5340","sourceWorkId":"21099","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/56/56164de6df888c887a0bcae45ce9da679d4a33550e1418ac37f297f2d1029508.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/11/110e56540af2eca092850c41c90597e26e7de41bbc663cd0c8b42bc40cdff39e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"雨宮侑布","creatorId":"vndb:s1450","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1450","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1450","name":"雨宮 侑布","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:167746:89981:4940:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c25601","characterName":"大門 奈緒子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"89982","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"167746"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5341"],"vndbCharacterId":"c25601"},"originalCharacterName":"大門 奈緒子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"48"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"91"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"89"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"64"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The headmistress of the school, a woman of a strange age with a child."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the embodiment of the school's \"academic supremacy\" policy. She has a high self-esteem and considers herself to be a special person."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As a married woman with a daughter, she has had some sexual experience."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is not interested in sex at all, thinking of it only as \"an act to make children\". but her mature body is becoming frustrated without her even realizing it."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c25601"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園長を務める、子持ちで妙齢の女性。気位が高く、本人は自分を特別な人間だと考えており、この学園の学力至上主義を体現した教師。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5341","sourceWorkId":"21099","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園長を務める、子持ちで妙齢の女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"この学園の “学力至上主義” を体現した教師。 気位が高く、自分を特別な人間だと考えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"娘を持つ人妻だけあって、一通りの性経験はある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"セックスはあくまで “子供作りのための行為” くらいにしか思っておらず、まったく興味が無い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし熟した身体は、本人も気付かないうちに欲求不満になっている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"89982"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"48 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5341","sourceWorkId":"21099","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"91 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5341","sourceWorkId":"21099","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"163 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5341","sourceWorkId":"21099","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5341","sourceWorkId":"21099","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"64 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5341","sourceWorkId":"21099","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5f/5f87ee83c960df0d95bd3222187e1e5fc7f1ec6aca712118c32dc463416ab928.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ac/aceda75c9d9fa419499648fec0f51e848f086458ea11aa96c06f1d2e408fab12.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐倉ゆき","creatorId":"vndb:s839","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s839","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s839","name":"佐倉 ゆき","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:167746:89982:15997:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c25602","characterName":"神楽坂 ゆい","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"89983","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"167746"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5342"],"vndbCharacterId":"c25602"},"originalCharacterName":"神楽坂 ゆい","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"93"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An student-teacher assigned to the protagonist's class."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a young lady who grew up in a box and has no knowledge of the world. She has little self-assertion."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has had a complex since childhood about her breasts, which are too large for her body."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has no experience in sex, and her knowledge of sex is limited to the level of health education."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a fiance, but the relationship is platonic, with no choice other than her parents' decision."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is not dissatisfied with her fiance and accepts it as such."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c25602"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のクラスに配属となった教育実習生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お嬢様そだちでで世間慣れしておらずそれがトラブルとなることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしそのガードの甘さと大きすぎる胸が男子生徒には人気。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5342","sourceWorkId":"21099","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のクラスに配属となった教育実習生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"箱入り育ちのお嬢様で世間知らず。 自己主張も薄い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身体つきに比べて大きすぎる胸は、子供の頃からのコンプレックス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"セックスの経験は無く、知識も保健体育レベルの知識のみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text